      "chain": [
        "RevolverItem实际hand use→转移speedloader弹药→发送slot+hand并设置reload=60；inventoryTick逐栈递减。",
        "MessageSpeedloaderSync客户端enqueueWork→指定hand仍为Revolver时写reload。",
        "生成revolver.json选择ie_obj/revolver/dynamic→IEOBJLoader→IEOBJModel→GeneralIEOBJModel.Overrides.resolve提取stack key→SpecificIEOBJModel.applyTransform。",
